sequenceDiagram
  actor Teacher as 教师
  participant View as TeacherGradeTable<br/>View
  participant Controller as GradeAnalysis<br/>Controller
  participant Service as GradeAnalysis<br/>Service
  participant Permission as CoursePermission<br/>Client
  participant ItemRepo as GradeItem<br/>Repository
  participant RecordRepo as GradeRecord<br/>Repository
  participant SummaryRepo as CourseGradeSummary<br/>Repository
  participant SnapshotRepo as GradeAnalysisSnapshot<br/>Repository
  Teacher->>View: 选择课程总评或成绩项维度
  View->>Controller: GET /courses/{courseId}/grade-analysis
  Controller->>Service: analyzeCourseGrades(courseId,teacherId,targetType,gradeItemId)
  Service->>Permission: canManageCourseGrade(courseId,teacherId)
  opt GRADE_ITEM 维度
    Service->>ItemRepo: findById(gradeItemId) 并校验课程
  end
  Service->>Permission: listCourseStudentIds(courseId)
  Permission-->>Service: 当前有效学生编号
  alt GRADE_ITEM 维度
    Service->>RecordRepo: findAnalysisSourceVersion(courseId,gradeItemId)
  else COURSE_TOTAL 维度
    Service->>SummaryRepo: findAnalysisSourceVersion(courseId)
  end
  Service->>SnapshotRepo: findLatest(courseId,targetType,gradeItemId)
  alt 契约/学生集合/来源版本指纹一致且计数完整
    SnapshotRepo-->>Service: 返回可复用快照
  else 快照缺失或失效
    alt GRADE_ITEM 维度
      Service->>RecordRepo: findByCourseId(courseId)
      RecordRepo-->>Service: 课程成绩记录集合
    else COURSE_TOTAL 维度
      Service->>SummaryRepo: findByCourseId(courseId)
      SummaryRepo-->>Service: 课程总评集合
    end
    Service->>Service: 计算指标、分布和空态计数
    Service->>SnapshotRepo: save(新快照)
  end
  Service-->>Controller: GradeAnalysisResult + sourceDataTime
  Controller-->>View: 指标或可解释空态
